    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12550" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόδρομος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δραμεῖν</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>apart from the race,</i> whether as <i>too old</i>
			or <i>too young</i> (as in Crete, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Leg.Gort.</u>
				7.35
			</span></i>) <i>to share it,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				727.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1592.55
			</span></i> sqq.; or <i>left behind by others,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				73
			</span></i>.</div>
